--- !u!114 &482622080
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 482622078}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Dearest Detective Jim, \t\r\nWhen my Lucy ran away, I was so devastated.
    After all, I spent countless years of my life devoting myself to studying her
    condition, solving its mystery was going to be my career making discovery. My
    ultimate triumph. When studying her from afar became too impossible, I made the
    greatest scientific advancement of all time. I only needed her brain, so why
    not\u2026 simply take it. Scientists of today are too scared to look at the research
    with controversial methods. Always so quick to judge. Dr. Frankenstein was a
    marvel, yet so many view him as satanist. What I have accomplished, brain transplants,
    is the greatest discovery of this world, and it enabled me to study Lucy\u2019s
    brain with all my resources and none of the liability of being linked to her.
    It truly is too bad she escaped in that meaningless woman, Angela\u2019s, body.
    Too bad she ran to you to stop my methods with that little note under the windshield\u2026
    How lucky I am that she would bring me someone with her same condition! Dearest
    Jim, thank you in advance for helping me to continue my research. I hope you
    take joy in knowing you will be a part of the next greatest medical discovery
    of our generation. Statues will be in my honour, all thanks to you. Too bad you
    won\u2019t be here to see it.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
